{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/5b9ed581-9077-4dd4-90a7-914b6a8d2104\";\nconst img = `${assetPathPrefix}/83ac5.svg`;\nconst img1 = `${assetPathPrefix}/c4e1e.svg`;\nconst img2 = `${assetPathPrefix}/a5de6.svg`;\n\nfunction NavStores({ className }: { className?: string }) {\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-white h-[60px] relative w-[390px]\"} data-node-id=\"336:783\" data-name=\"САДОХОД / nav / stores\">\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[52.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:784\" data-name=\"Магазины\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[169.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:789\" data-name=\"Камера\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img1} />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute left-[286.5px] size-[27px] top-[16.5px]\" data-node-id=\"336:792\" data-name=\"Профиль\">\n        <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={img2} />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function Component22() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#f0efeb] relative size-full\" data-node-id=\"419:530\" data-name=\"22 · Первый запуск · Нет магазинов\">\n      <NavStores className=\"absolute bg-white bottom-0 h-[60px] left-0 w-[390px]\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] h-[60px] left-0 top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"419:596\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Магазин\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[130px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"419:597\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Камера\" />\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[60px] left-[260px] top-[640px] w-[130px]\" data-node-id=\"419:598\" data-name=\"FLOW / Низ / Профиль\" />\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Bold'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[18px] text-black text-center top-[220px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"419:613\">\n        у вас пока нет магазинов\n      </p>\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[#a5a5a5] text-[13px] text-center top-[254px] w-[304px]\" data-node-id=\"419:614\">\n        Добавьте магазин, чтобы размещать товары.\n      </p>\n      <div className=\"absolute bg-[#48352d] h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[24px] top-[331px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"419:615\" data-name=\"Кнопка / Добавить магазин\" />\n      <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['Helvetica:Regular'] leading-[normal] left-[195px] not-italic text-[16px] text-center text-white top-[345px] w-[294px]\" data-node-id=\"419:616\">\n        добавить магазин\n      </p>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0)] block cursor-pointer h-[48px] left-[30px] rounded-[24px] top-[331px] w-[330px]\" data-node-id=\"419:617\" data-name=\"PROTO / Добавить магазин\" />\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: beige: #F0EFEB."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
